# @slow
# Test: first purchase placed (replaces the first_purchase_placed
# replay spec). On day 2 it buys the seeded $5 Table at
# (-11, -27.5) in the store spawn rows.
# The store exit validates balance >= cart, so the script first
# serves both night-1 customers: when the second takes their
# drink, the first reaches the pay queue front and pays.

